      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "P.W.5 who is the investigating officer and some other formal witnesses only are to be examined and therefore, the trial would be concluded in a short time and thus no useful purpose would be served keeping, in view the conduct of the applicant, to release him on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
