    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "6.It appears from a perusal of the order dated 7.6.2023 passed by the Sessions Judge that the accused not on one but on several occasions has tried to disrupt the proceedings of the trial in such a heinous offence while on bail and therefore, I am of the opinion that the applicant is not entitled to be enlarged on bail.\nBesides the applicant is the husband and main accused in the trial and therefore, no parity can be given with the bail order of co-accused Saghir.\n7.The application is accordingly rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
